error: fm-brief.sh --forge: forge=gitlab cannot ship mode=local-only - that mode publishes nothing, so a forge has no meaning there, and its landing would fast-forward local main with content the review server has never seen; ship no-mistakes or direct-PR, which publish through the forge
[exit 1]

